    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "朱雀さん、こちらが先日お話した、\nCMの撮影で使うヘアワックスのサンプルです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサーさんよぉっ、ありがとな！\nこれが新作のヘアワックスか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ヘヘッ、サンプルをもらえるって聞いて、\nどんなヤツなのか楽しみにしてたんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "イカしてるパッケージだぜッ！\nいよっし、さっそく使ってみるか！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うおおおッ！？　な、なんだこれ……。\nめちゃくちゃセットしやすい！　スッゲー！！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "前回のヘアワックスから改良を重ねたと、\n担当の方がおっしゃってました。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 14
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうなのか……。キャッチコピー通り、\nバシッと髪型がキマって、マジでスッゲー！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 15
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "って、スッゲーしか言ってねぇな。\nいやでも、ホントにそんくらいスッゲーんだよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "025suz",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 16
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_01:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "撮影は来週になります。ヘアワックスの魅力を\n存分に出せるように、頑張りましょうね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
